xt":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/fb1c8fe2eef10fbdec51057c21ae306f545fd5eb.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /> should have finite number of discontinuities within any finite interval.</p>\n</div>","isCorrect":true}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>\n (a, c, d)</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/453dfdfe6d34980b522a98b978e545d4f55a16cc.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"}],"questionCount":17,"parsedAt":"2026-11-10T19:39:16.362Z"}